+## Windows community patch
+
+This working copy adds YouTube Music search and background playback to the Windows island, a separate music volume control, and a session-scoped Auto Allow switch for agent permissions. Only the Windows app was changed.
+
+**Coucou was created by [Louis Raillé (Louis-CFM)](https://github.com/Louis-CFM).** Thank you, Louis, for creating Coucou and sharing its source. Thanks also to the contributors who maintain the project. The [original Coucou repository](https://github.com/Louis-CFM/coucou) is the home of official releases.
+
 ## Why
 
 Some studios showed off gorgeous notch companions… and never let anyone use them.
